4938904,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXix0GA","user":{"login":"tsgx1990","id":13202657,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjAyNjU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13202657?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsgx1990","html_url":"https://github.com/tsgx1990","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsgx1990/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsgx1990/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsgx1990/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsgx1990/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsgx1990/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsgx1990/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsgx1990/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsgx1990/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsgx1990/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T17:14:17Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T17:14:17Z","body":"Follow-up: the workaround is confirmed in a real project.\n\nOur tray menu is a `StatusIndicator` whose native `PopupMenu` has one submenu per entry, and it is rebuilt with `clear()` whenever the list changes. It crashed every time an action was picked from one of those submenus (same `Attempting to use an uninitialized RID` + signal 5). After moving the rebuild to `call_deferred()`, so that it runs after the already-queued `_menu_close_cb()`, the same actions no longer crash. They were clicked through repeatedly by hand.\n\n(I have not re-run the MRP itself with `_rebuild.call_deferred()`; the confirmation above comes from the real project.)\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5874938904/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimiz